I don't think using delta_thetas in a multidimensional context is a good idea as for models containing simple structure only some of the latent trait estimates will be updated after an item is administered, so you'll get a false sense of security when on trait becomes accurate while others are simply not updated. As to why this occurs after 1 item I'm not sure, though I'd be happy to track this down if you can provide a reprex.

Phil

