Hi Youngjin,

The issue is that custom_den() function must return a vector to work correctly, where use with EAP estimators sometimes makes this a matrix due to R's matrix rules (there's other technical reasons for this not worth going into). This is why in the documentation it's indicated that the result 'must be a numeric vector' to work, so use as.numeric() to drop the result from a matrix to a vector instead (see examples as this occurs there too). HTH for now.

Phil

